= Paris Attacks

Coordinated terrorist attacks have killed 130 people in Paris. In the United States a fierce debate begins over refugees and security.

- @refugees_welcome: Defend refugee resettlement
- @refugees_vetting: Support stricter vetting

@refugees_welcome
on-arrival: progressive_dissent -= 3; rural_dem -= 2*(1-dissent); maga_strength += 1.5; minority_dem += 1*(1-dissent)

We argue that refusing refugees hands the terrorists a victory.

@refugees_vetting
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 4; maga_strength -= 0.5

We back tougher screening while keeping the program alive.
